 to  do the things that the Boy Scouts do in  the past two and a half years the Boy  Scouts also announced it would allow  gay leaders and transgender Scouts and  while critics say these moves are simply  a reaction to diminishing membership  numbers Scout leaders say it's all about  fairness  watch out thank you so much we disagree  without notes are good okay no I agree  girls can do anything I just like Boy  Scouts and Girl Scouts
 

